text = "- Read the dialogs and pick the citizens documents;
- Be careful and take a look at the document's informations and see if there is any wrong information;
- Pick a citadel pass and stamp it with the green or red stamper (green is the circle and red is the square one);
- Give back the citizen document and give the citadel pass to him/her and finish the service;"

